### 2. Listar Profissionais (Rota Pública)
GET {{baseUrl}}/professionals/list
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

---

### 3. Buscar Detalhes de um Profissional
GET {{baseUrl}}/professionals/{{professionalId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

---

